  "description": "Never lose what you've copied again. Access your clipboard history instantly and paste any previous item with a single click or keyboard shortcut.\n\n            Supports text, image, URLs, colors, app link, HTML, RTF and more.\n\n            What's new:\n            - Added translation for French\n            - Fixed and issue where text from a web page would appear with version numbers in the clipboard.\n            - You can now delete an item from the history, or clear the history.",
